summary:
  A reading ended before its address was written down leaves the address
  file behind.

history:
  The end's rm can run ahead of the write. StreamKind had exactly this
  fault: a file holding a stream's address, with nobody left to remove it.

target:
  package/contents/ui/Loudness.qml

find:
                  if (sweep !== "") app.exec(sweep);

replace:
                  if (sweep === "") app.exec(sweep);

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_loudness.qml::test_a_reading_ended_between_its_two_commands_leaves_no_file.
  Line-neutral.
